<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="display: none"></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="display: none"></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="display: none"></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AA_zhpKdQ1EzrJ7" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">Optex
Systems (OPX) &#8211; Richardson, Texas</span></i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Optex
Richardson revenues are primarily in support of prime and subcontracted military customers. Approximately <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--DomesticMilitaryCustomersMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zGRm9h8EPd28" title="Percentage of revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_DomesticMilitaryCustomersMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact000875" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">90</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Optex Richardson
segment revenue is comprised of domestic military customers, and <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--ForeignMilitaryCustomersMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zGPDpXuSdwqd" title="Percentage of revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_ForeignMilitaryCustomersMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact000877" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span>% is comprised of foreign military customers. For the twelve months
ended September 28, 2025, Optex Richardson represented<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zWDMEU5joL0c" title="Percentage of revenue"> <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact000879" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">58</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Company&#8217;s total consolidated revenue and consisted of the U.S.
government, <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--USDefenseContractorOneMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zpyZWDzxOPCl" title="Percentage of revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_USDefenseContractorOneMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact000881" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">22</ix:nonFraction></span>%, and two major U.S. defense contractors representing <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--USGovernmentMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zYPoSHsd1Ffe" title="Percentage of revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_USGovernmentMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact000883" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">15</ix:nonFraction></span>% and <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--USDefenseContractorTwoMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zSkGVzxHE1Eg" title="Percentage of revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_USDefenseContractorTwoMember_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact000885" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span>%, of the Company&#8217;s consolidated revenue, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Optex
Richardson is located in Richardson Texas, with leased premises consisting of approximately <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--AreaOfLand_iI_usqft_c20240929__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zwkwpqbmIGAf" title="Leased facilities"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AreaOfLand" contextRef="AsOf2024-09-29_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact000887" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="sqft">49,100</ix:nonFraction></span> square feet. As of September 28, 2025,
the Richardson facility operated with <span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--NumberOfEmployees_uInteger_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember_zlnRtUt62EMk" title="Number of employees"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:NumberOfEmployees" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_OptexSystemsOPXRichardsonTexasMember" id="Fact000889" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">87</ix:nonFraction></span> full-time equivalent employees in a single shift operation. The facilities at Optex Richardson
serve as the home office for both the Optex Richardson and Applied Optics Center segments.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">Applied
Optics Center (AOC) &#8211; Dallas, Texas</span></i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Applied Optics Center serves primarily domestic U.S. customers. Sales to commercial customers represent <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20240930__20250928__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--CommercialCustomersMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zMecXRn0BSqj" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_CommercialCustomersMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact000891" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span>% and military sales to prime
and subcontracted customers represent <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20240930__20250928__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--SubcontractedCustomersMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zt0y1W1g8lbe" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_SubcontractedCustomersMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact000893" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">90</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the total segment revenue. Approximately <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20240930__20250928__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--ExternalCustomersMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zgbv4S2Yv8Pf" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_ExternalCustomersMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact000895" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">94</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the AOC revenue is derived from external
customers and approximately <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20240930__20250928__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--MilitaryContractsMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__custom--IntersegmentSalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zkqI3dXzJ5ba" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_MilitaryContractsMember_custom_IntersegmentSalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact000897" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">6</ix:nonFraction></span>% is related to intersegment sales to Optex Richardson in support of military contracts. For the twelve
months ended September 28, 2025, AOC represented <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zbIV0R8NwcF2" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact000899" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">42</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Company&#8217;s total consolidated revenue and consisted of revenue from
the U.S. government, <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20240930__20250928__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--USGovernmentMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zmYoFWAKxvUi" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_USGovernmentMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact000901" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">5</ix:nonFraction></span>%, and two major defense contractors representing <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20240930__20250928__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--MajorUSDefenseContractorOneMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zVjR4XmxHNyh" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_MajorUSDefenseContractorOneMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact000903" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">6</ix:nonFraction></span>% and <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_c20240930__20250928__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--MajorUSDefenseContractorTwoMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zu1CGKWx5zy3" title="Concentration risk percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_MajorUSDefenseContractorTwoMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact000905" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">6</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Company&#8217;s consolidated revenue, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Applied Optics Center is located in Dallas, Texas with leased premises consisting of approximately <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--AreaOfLand_iI_usqft_c20250928__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zStV02WyHz32" title="Leased facilities"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AreaOfLand" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-28_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact000907" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="sqft">44,867</ix:nonFraction></span> square feet of space. As of
September 28, 2025, AOC operated with <span id="xdx_90B_ecustom--NumberOfEmployees_uInteger_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis__custom--AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember_zPBHu93FW7Zg" title="Number of employees"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:NumberOfEmployees" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_AppliedOpticsCenterAOCDallasMember" id="Fact000909" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">45</ix:nonFraction></span> full-time equivalent employees in a single shift operation.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


