<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeaseDescription_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--LeaseContractualTermAxis__custom--OneNonCancellableOfficeEquipmentLeaseMember_zKbyfepmePu9" title="Lease description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_OneNonCancellableOfficeEquipmentLeaseMember" id="Fact001213" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseDescription">The
Company had one non-cancellable office equipment lease with a commencement date of October 1, 2018 and a term of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract_iI_dtM_c20250928__us-gaap--LeaseContractualTermAxis__custom--OneNonCancellableOfficeEquipmentLeaseMember_zMPhFQ7YW4u4" title="Lease term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-09-28_custom_OneNonCancellableOfficeEquipmentLeaseMember" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" id="Fact001215" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract">39</ix:nonNumeric></span> months. The lease
cost for the equipment was $1.5 thousand per month from October 1, 2018 through December 31, 2021. The lease was renewed on November
18, 2021 for an additional 48 months at a cost of $1.2 thousand per month.</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

