    $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DeferredRentCredit_iI_pn3n3_c20250928_z3n2V3TCgBLf" title="Unamortized deferred rent" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNjaGVkdWxlIG9mIE5vbi1jYW5jZWxsYWJsZSBPcGVyYXRpbmcgTGVhc2VzIE1pbmltdW0gUGF5bWVudHMgKERldGFpbHMpIChQYXJlbnRoZXRpY2FsKQA_"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DeferredRentCredit" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-28" id="Fact001284" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">150</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand of unamortized deferred rent.</ix:footnote></i></span></td></tr>
</table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A4_zRzThWN6Hkuf" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Total
expense under both facility lease agreements for the twelve months ended September 28, 2025 was $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--LeaseCost_pn3n3_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--FacilityLeaseAgreementMember_zb8zQHREA2j6" title="Operating lease cost"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LeaseCost" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_FacilityLeaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001286" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">951</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand. Total expense under both
facility lease agreements as of the twelve months ended September 29, 2024 was $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--LeaseCost_pn3n3_c20231002__20240929__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--FacilityLeaseAgreementMember_zaUuSRbqRuEk" title="Operating lease cost"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LeaseCost" contextRef="From2023-10-022024-09-29_custom_FacilityLeaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001288" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">905</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Total
office equipment rentals included in operating expenses was $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseExpense_pn3n3_c20240930__20250928__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--FacilityLeaseAgreementMember_zrjMZQieNrnf" title="Office equipment rent"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" contextRef="From2024-09-302025-09-28_custom_FacilityLeaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001290" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">21</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand for the twelve months ended September 28, 2025 and $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseExpense_pn3n3_c20231002__20240929__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--FacilityLeaseAgreementMember_z57vUdLDi9f" title="Office equipment rent"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" contextRef="From2023-10-022024-09-29_custom_FacilityLeaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001292" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">24</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand
for the twelve months ended September 29, 2024.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 58; Value: 2 -->
