<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Restricted
Stock Units</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
May 1, 2024, the Company granted an aggregate of <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20240501__20240501__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember_zbM4ROfUHSq5"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2024-05-012024-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001428" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">39,000</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units to eleven employees under its 2023 Equity Incentive Plan.
As of the grant date, assuming a <span id="xdx_909_ecustom--ForfeitureRate_pid_dp_c20240501__20240501__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember_zm33N6p7rkK2"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:ForfeitureRate" contextRef="From2024-05-012024-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001429" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">7.7</ix:nonFraction></span>% forfeiture rate based on expected turnover across the three years, the aggregate value of the restricted
stock units is $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_pn3n3_c20240501__20240501__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember_zj3j2xzCEPae"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-05-012024-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001430" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">258</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand which will be amortized across the three-year period on a straight-line basis. The restricted stock units
will vest at a rate of <span id="xdx_900_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested_pid_dp_uPure_c20240501__20240501__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember_zdtrhFxaOHF4"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested" contextRef="From2024-05-012024-05-01_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001431" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">33.33</ix:nonFraction></span>% annually on the anniversary date of the grant and any unvested restricted stock units will be forfeited
if employment terminates prior to the relevant vesting date. On June 4, 2024 there was an additional grant of <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_c20240604__20240604__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneNewEmployeeMember_zL30jGicMvI1"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2024-06-042024-06-04_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_custom_OneNewEmployeeMember" id="Fact001432" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">500</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units
to one employee with a fair value of $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_pn3n3_c20240604__20240604__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneNewEmployeeMember_zwkJDiDkrmX9"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-06-042024-06-04_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_custom_OneNewEmployeeMember" id="Fact001433" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">4</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand. The <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_c20240604__20240604__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneNewEmployeeMember_z2pyMMAKgrb1"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2024-06-042024-06-04_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_custom_OneNewEmployeeMember" id="Fact001434" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">500</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units will vest <span id="xdx_908_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested_pid_dp_uPure_c20240604__20240604__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember_zyysR2OpLMu"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested" contextRef="From2024-06-042024-06-04_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember" id="Fact001435" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">100</ix:nonFraction></span>% on the anniversary date of the grant
and will be forfeited if employment terminates prior to the relevant vesting date. On July 3, 2024 there was an additional grant of <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20240703__20240703__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember_zEVDnhoDsCo9" title="Restricted stock, grant"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2024-07-032024-07-03_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001437" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
restricted stock units to one employee with a fair value of $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_pn3n3_c20240703__20240703__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--OneNewEmployeeMember_zSImafisOlUe" title="Restricted stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-07-032024-07-03_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_custom_OneNewEmployeeMember" id="Fact001439" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">7</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand. The <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20240703__20240703__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember_zRzg6hLqDUu7"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2024-07-032024-07-03_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001440" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,000</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted stock units will vest <span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested_pid_dp_uPure_c20240703__20240703__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember_zTTEknF5DzY3" title="Share based compensation percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="OPXS:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardRestrictedStockUnitsVested" contextRef="From2024-07-032024-07-03_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001442" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">100</ix:nonFraction></span>% on the anniversary
date of the grant and will be forfeited if employment terminates prior to the relevant vesting date.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the twelve months ended September 29, 2024, there were <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod_pid_c20231002__20240929__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember_znu6phrlHQNa" title="Restricted stock, vested"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" contextRef="From2023-10-022024-09-29_custom_TwoThousandTwentyThreeEquityIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001444" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">13,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares vested under its 2023 Equity Incentive Plan for restricted stock
units granted on May 1, 2023 and August 14, 2023, which resulted in <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedNumber_iI_pid_c20230814__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember_z1QcoThieAwi" title="Restricted stock, issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedNumber" contextRef="AsOf2023-08-14_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember" id="Fact001446" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">9,150</ix:nonFraction></span> shares issued to eleven employees, net of tax withheld of $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--AdjustmentsRelatedToTaxWithholdingForShareBasedCompensation_pn3n3_c20230814__20230814__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ElevenEmployeesMember_zagHb2l5HMS9" title="Amount of tax withholding obligation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AdjustmentsRelatedToTaxWithholdingForShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2023-08-142023-08-14_custom_ElevenEmployeesMember" id="Fact001448" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">28</ix:nonFraction></span>
thousand.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

